  "case_notes": [
    "Bypass did not fire. Channel and CI match the remembered normal because 33 of the 37 releases in the trailing 730 days were manual publishes; the four trusted-publisher releases are recent. Provenance, verified, key and artifact-vs-tag are not recorded for the removed versions, so those properties are NOT_COMPUTED.",
