    "This is an unflattering result for the frozen 730-day window: it is published as is."
  ],
  "honesty": [
    "One real incident per case is too few to claim precision (spec §10.2).",
    "Published as measured: a result that fired late, or not at all, is shown as it was.",
    "Rush: the registry records no grant event. A GRANTED edge is placed at the first version that lists the maintainer, which for a newcomer is also their first release, so days-to-grant is 0 by construction of the record. A Rush FIRED here is an effect of that record, not independent evidence.",
    "Lone keeper counts commit authors in the trailing 90 days; npm data has no commits, so only the guardians half of the flag can be set."
  ],
